1	Sales Representative	Tchokhonelidze Irine	Алматы	New Life Kazakhstan, part of the global network of In Vitro Fertilization clinics and Surrogacy Agencies which currently operate in different Countries is pleased to announce the vacancy of Sales Representative.   Responsibilities:    Follow up on leads, answer customer questions, provide information, negotiate sales terms and cultivate relationship with customers. Recruit sufficient number of Egg Donors and Surrogate mothers on a weekly basis. Maintain relationships with customers and be informed on products and services. Be knowledgeable about current market conditions and competitor information. Engage in calling, networking and attending sales meetings to build relationships with clients. Maintain accurate records of sales activities, achieve sales target, meet sales quotas and contribute to overall growth of the company. Work in data management system on a daily basis (intranet) to accurately manage and qualify leads. Data management in order to provide accurate weekly and monthly report to management team.    Skills and Qualifications:   Customer service skills to listen to the concerns of a customer and be able to address their needs. Proven work experience as a sales representative Interpersonal skills to work with variety of people each day, build relationship and network Confidence and strong self-assuredness to succeed in calling customers and making sales. Communication skills, especially persuasion, to clearly convey the benefits of services to potential customers. Physical endurance as sales representative may need to work off hours. Highly motivated and target driven with a proven track record in sales. Relationship management skills and openness to feedback. Able to travel abroad Advance knowledge of English language is a must.    Salary/Benefits:     Ability to travel. Bonus system on top of the salary Multicultural environment Salary will be negotiated according to candidate’s experience, expectati